          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We want you to love your BeeBlend honey! If you’re not completely satisfied, we’re here to help.</p><p></p><h2>Returns</h2><p>Due to the perishable nature of our products, we can only accept returns on unopened and unused items within 14 daysof delivery.</p><p>To initiate a return, please email <a href=\"mailto:support@beeblend.co.uk\">support@beeblend.co.uk</a> with your order number and reason for return. We’ll provide you with return instructions.</p><p></p><h2>Refunds</h2><p>Once your return is received and inspected, we’ll notify you by email. If approved, your refund will be processed to your original payment method within 5–7 business days.</p><p></p><h2>Non-Returnable Items</h2><p>We cannot accept returns on:</p><ul><li>Opened or used food items</li><li>Gift cards or promotional items</li><li>Products purchased through third-party retailers</li></ul><p></p><h2>Exchanges</h2><p>If you received a damaged or incorrect item, please contact us within 7 days of delivery, and we’ll replace it free of charge.</p>"
